<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. KLIC example; preserve bundled per-file license notices. -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="notification" data-kv-variant="file-processing" data-klic-component="notification" class="kn-notification"><article data-part="notification"><div class="ku-row" data-part="row"><span><i data-part="icon" data-lucide="file-text" aria-hidden="true"></i> 브랜드 가이드.pdf</span><span><span data-part="badge">처리 중</span></span></div><label data-part="progress-label">내용 분석<span>72%</span><progress max="100" value="72">72%</progress></label><p data-part="muted">분석을 마치면 문서 목록에서 확인할 수 있습니다.</p><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="notification-read"  data-part="btn">처리 알림 끄기</button><output aria-live="polite" data-part="output"></output></article></div>
